### Kitchen Service API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen
### Via Gateway: http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kitchen

### =============================================
### Queue Status
### =============================================

### Get kitchen queue status for restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/queue/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get queue status via API Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kitchen/queue/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### =============================================
### Kitchen Order Management
### =============================================

### Get a specific kitchen order
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update order status to PREPARING
PATCH http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PREPARING",
  "assignedStation": "Station A"
}

###

### Update order status to READY
PATCH http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "READY"
}

###

### Update order status to PICKED_UP
PATCH http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PICKED_UP"
}

###

### =============================================
### Shortcut Endpoints
### =============================================

### Start preparing order (shortcut)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/start?station=Station%20A
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Mark order as ready (shortcut)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/ready
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Mark order as picked up (shortcut)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/pickup
Content-Type: application/json

###

### =============================================
### Via API Gateway
### =============================================

### Get queue status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kitchen/queue/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Start order via gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/start?station=Oven%201
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Mark ready via gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kitchen/orders/1/ready
Content-Type: application/json

###

### =============================================
### WebSocket Connection Info
### =============================================

# WebSocket Endpoint: ws://localhost:8084/ws/kitchen
# With SockJS fallback: http://localhost:8084/ws/kitchen
#
# Subscribe to restaurant updates:
#   SUBSCRIBE /topic/kitchen/{restaurantId}
#
# Send commands:
#   SEND /app/kitchen/{restaurantId}/status           -> Get queue status
#   SEND /app/kitchen/{restaurantId}/order/{id}/start -> Start preparing
#   SEND /app/kitchen/{restaurantId}/order/{id}/ready -> Mark ready
#   SEND /app/kitchen/{restaurantId}/order/{id}/pickup -> Mark picked up

###

